{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e726065ef579b203348ec2f2b5daa7bc6edc6f84bf6bf2db02e8bac8c39d5630",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e88f63a6d1d6f1ca8de5f88f180a30e412f3342fa3783f04f9db7b7a3f2560e7",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー酱？\n今天的录制辛苦啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:224dd8217cc8590b86a6dd990adbd5270181d29b4fdefff49e8738337cb3e726",
      "text": "访谈环节和演唱会都非常热闹呢！\n我都等不及想看播出的那天了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e05d06bb435f0d67abbe9257d572b4b4612a4f8e7b30f966692eff55aaa17941",
      "text": "到了演唱会环节，\n气氛突然就变了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb435424e81c6aa3ad887281ec7f6d6b815ae48d0a29f6561b24d1f7447021aa",
      "text": "您的谈话水平\n太厉害了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81c6e7c42b33e7975d9ed2d219fd36d1614d0e2f6f6295cf06c947a4085ed9c8",
      "text": "因为谈话环节很放松，所以反差就体现出来了，\n大概是这种感觉吧。布景也很棒，很容易进入状态呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca5d32fe14115a063a8d9cc4a7088c6f8d2c0f4cc84586f8abc330d75e858ff2",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢。因为大家的反应都很新鲜，\n我也就很好聊得开啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0856737effbaac58d1c87bb8fb2d6fd9575e3548cfe457b8abc2a0b0010128e7",
      "text": "虽说我在电视上说话算是比较习惯的，\n本来还想着要是能带带他们就好了，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e82df91e0bbb849b74a25752c21e3fbe33ee203fa4267fa630506a52b74f5087",
      "text": "但倒不如说正因为有那些孩子在，\n我反而才能表现得这么无拘无束呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cd8a4018ba4c7d4f591db304131f94fa9260f70bf6322f9b5ca2d7aa0e1a213",
      "text": "身边坐着同事务所的伙伴，果然让人心里踏实呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15a84da979e6baee1b04f7c64cfe2c735adb29d815852bfa01f7e906e25969df",
      "text": "不过，下次我们得变得更出名才行，\n争取让电视台单给彩做个特集！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0394f445c5a748aced53b818e5237ea20338e55bd3600f816bdc4dbaecf6ca9e",
      "text": "要是到了那个时候，该聊些什么好呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5951d7cb80a1b6642432ac06d4c52f15c55cd958d79c921ad564ceebd65c137",
      "text": "适合在访谈中聊的回忆，今后也得继续\n多多增加才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2550e21894cd45e51a00a3469266b1f9a8edcdbff18a783844537c4095047cf",
      "text": "好啦。为了明天也能好好工作，\n今天我也差不多该睡了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a412c6984d3784c0b10508e05508c86278683368bee7f136da5bd6d6482d070",
      "text": "制作人酱也别忙到太晚，\n要好好休息哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_402_2_4_018_02_09_a:2_4_018_02_09_a:cmd-000038:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14f7fdda16a18c4c759e4461823c72ecf9ac6053897ca86c3b4b3ef360e69cb9",
      "text": "那么，下一份工作也拜托你啦。\n晚安♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
